BT 36.85 700.40 Td (and institutions. It allows students to upload study material and generate) Tj ET
BT 36.85 681.98 Td (practice papers, extract hot/important topics using AI, cluster previous-year) Tj ET
BT 36.85 663.55 Td (questions, and access class/university resources through role-based dashboards) Tj ET
BT 36.85 645.13 Td (\(Student, Teacher, Admin\). The backend exposes a REST API that handles document) Tj ET
q BT 36.85 626.70 Td 5.797 Tw (processing \(OCR / PDF extraction\), AI-based content extraction, database) Tj ET Q
BT 36.85 608.28 Td (storage) Tj ET
BT 36.85 589.85 Td (and PDF generation. The frontend is a single-page application providing the) Tj ET
BT 36.85 571.42 Td (student, teacher and admin interfaces.) Tj ET
