BT 36.85 388.59 Td (Markup / Styling : HTML, CSS \(Tailwind CSS\)) Tj ET
BT 36.85 367.33 Td (Other            : OCR \(pytesseract, PyMuPDF\), ReportLab \(PDF generation\)) Tj ET
